{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf09 \u3010Up to 8 Player Multiplayer\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Life-or-Death Bridge-Building Challenge Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the effects of global warming, Antarctica has fractured into countless pieces. Your mission is to build bridges between the scattered Antarctic fragments and <strong>&quot;LINK&quot;</strong> them together! Play solo or in multiplayer to unite Antarctica once again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the bridge to the designated location.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddca STEP 1: Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are randomly generated every time. Develop the best construction plan! <i>Something</i> may change as time passes. Always anticipate the worst-case scenario.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f STEP 2: Building the Bridge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, connect them, and build your bridge! Here are some key points to watch out for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bridge may collapse if the ends are overloaded.</strong> Reinforce it properly by connecting to various spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be mindful of your weight.</strong> Your weight is also your physical strength, so maintain a balanced diet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful at night.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 STEP 3: Transporting Cargo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the bridge you built and transport the cargo to the opposite shore. There are many factors to consider\u2014your weight, the cargo's weight, the bridge's strength... but we know you can do it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demo version will be released as soon as the game is reasonably complete. Development progress will be continuously posted on X (formerly Twitter)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5 Regarding Videos and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are welcome. Please ensure the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Include the name of this game in the title.</strong> (Mandatory)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Include the Steam store page URL in the description box.</strong> (Optional)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1767595314","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1767595314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/75d250506ef63c63f2e370485f6e727d5fe61185/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767595314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/75d250506ef63c63f2e370485f6e727d5fe61185/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767595314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf09 \u3010Up to 8 Player Multiplayer\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Life-or-Death Bridge-Building Challenge Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the effects of global warming, Antarctica has fractured into countless pieces. Your mission is to build bridges between the scattered Antarctic fragments and <strong>&quot;LINK&quot;</strong> them together! Play solo or in multiplayer to unite Antarctica once again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect the bridge to the designated location.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddca STEP 1: Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are randomly generated every time. Develop the best construction plan! <i>Something</i> may change as time passes. Always anticipate the worst-case scenario.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f STEP 2: Building the Bridge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, connect them, and build your bridge! Here are some key points to watch out for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The bridge may collapse if the ends are overloaded.</strong> Reinforce it properly by connecting to various spots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be mindful of your weight.</strong> Your weight is also your physical strength, so maintain a balanced diet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be careful at night.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 STEP 3: Transporting Cargo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the bridge you built and transport the cargo to the opposite shore. There are many factors to consider\u2014your weight, the cargo's weight, the bridge's strength... but we know you can do it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Demo Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demo version will be released as soon as the game is reasonably complete. Development progress will be continuously posted on X (formerly Twitter)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5 Regarding Videos and Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos and streaming are welcome. Please ensure the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Include the name of this game in the title.</strong> (Mandatory)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Include the Steam store page URL in the description box.</strong> (Optional)</p></li></ul>","developers":["lemorion_1224"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services ","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/975d7c045d469ef825cd4bb3d94361aaea9312de/header.jpg?t=1767595314","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"LINK Penguins","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12 compatible graphics card</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["lemorion_1224"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q1 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3/ss_21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767595314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3/ss_21c54915deae15558778f1fd2a9635e58c2743f3.600x338.jpg?t=1767595314"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338/ss_1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767595314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338/ss_1b54d239dc6f42e4b2da999b9db7617b84755338.600x338.jpg?t=1767595314"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akama